# The Holodeck's way for the graveyard plays a land card there (CR 305.1, 604.1): Bot1 sacrifices Unexplored Territory
# for a Forest and plays the Territory again from its graveyard on its next turn as that turn's land play. That spends the
# once (one permission between both zones), so the Forest outside the game can't be played that turn.

