Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus#1.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus#1.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.The Holodeck.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
